    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but thats the thing though. i feel like im just pretending. like i'm just going through the motions to keep up appearances for everyone else, but there's nothing inside. it's like the real me died a long time ago and this current version is just a hollow shell. it feels so exhausting to keep performing a life that doesn't even feel real anymore.",
